    "6": {
      "note": "Each leaf has one primary requirement revision and adjacent revisions remain constraints. The Manager inspects the complete changed-file diff, both verdicts and the Worker's report of any required final checks. It preserves stable requirement and finding identifiers and distinguishes implementation, review, curation and publication.",
      "targets": [
