    "7": {
      "note": "The Manager may start an Investigator under its own master, naming its sprint when one commands it, for a check belonging to no leaf, sends the scoped concern first to its returned ID, and exercises its three-way authority split including standing routine paired closeout.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "anchor": {
