    },
    "8": {
      "note": "The Manager settles precedent-covered matters with non-reclaiming case reservations, records approval for a round beyond the settings limit, sends Architect and developer matters upward, and owns stage boundaries and repair of its own mistaken records or addresses; covered correct writes use the named recovery route.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "anchor": {
