      "note": "Manager starts Worker, Reviewer and Curator individually at build, freeze and code PASS; ordinary peer handovers stay direct. It owns whole-stage transaction boundaries, repairs its own recording/address/input faults and requests beyond-settings rounds through its assigned reporting route with the Worker's property-and-construction account.",
